{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Wisdom 15 or higher\n\nYou don’t like being manipulated or controlled, especially by magic. That’s why you’ve developed psychic countermeasures against anyone trying to mess with your mind or emotions.\n\n- You gain a +5 against Charisma (Persuasion), Charisma (Deception) and Charisma (Intimidation) checks.\n\n- If you succeed on a Wisdom or Intelligence saving throw, deal Psychic damage equal to your roll + your Wisdom modifier to the creature if it is within 120ft of you. You also gain advantage on your next Wisdom or Intelligence saving throw if you fail the roll.\n\n- When you receive Psychic damage you can use your reaction to gain resistance to it until the start of your next turn.","level":1}],"id":"Custom683e5ad7-4131-48ca-9cea-89245d9c11b3","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Deadly Mind [SM] [Revised]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}